"""Chebyshev panels of lgamma and digamma for the Numba GammaLn and Psi kernels.

Fitted in mpmath at 40 digits by the gammaln generator of chebax
(https://github.com/andreshernandez-spec/chebax). Each octave [2**e, 2**(e + 1))
of [1, 64) holds 32 equal panels: row 32 * e + m holds, lowest first, the
coefficients in powers of s in [-1, 1] of the Chebyshev series, cut to degree 7,
of the function on 2**e * [1 + m / 32, 1 + (m + 1) / 32], s affine in x.
LGAMMA rows 0-63 hold lgamma(x) / ((x - 1) * (x - 2)), the rest lgamma(x).
PSI rows 0-31 hold digamma(x) / (x - x0), x0 = X0_HI + X0_LO its positive
zero, the rest digamma(x). STIRLING[k] = B(2k + 2) / ((2k + 2) (2k + 1)).

The names ending in 32 are the float32 kernels' tables: the same series cut to
degree 3 (lgamma) and 4 (digamma), two Stirling terms, and x0 split for float32.
"""

